    "coreTexts": {
      "zh-CN": "「11号」在[普通攻击]或[冲刺攻击]中触发[火力镇压]时，招式造成的伤害提升70%。"
    },
    "additionalAbilityTexts": {
      "zh-CN": "队伍中存在与自身属性或阵营相同的角色时触发：\n「11号」造成的火属性伤害提升10%，攻击处于失衡状态下的敌人时，该增益效果额外提升22.5%。"
    },
    "cinemaTexts": [
      {
        "en": "When Soldier 11 becomes the active character in combat, if her Energy is less than 40, her Energy is recovered to 80. This effect can trigger once every 50s.",
        "zh-CN": "成为接战状态下的当前操作角色时，若「11号」的能量不足40点，则立即回复至80点，50秒内最多触发一次。"
      },
      {
        "en": "When triggering Fire Suppression, Basic Attack, Dash Attack, and Dodge Counter DMG increases by 3%, up to 12 stacks, lasting 15s, with the duration of each stack calculated separately.",
        "zh-CN": "触发[火力镇压]时，[普通攻击]、[冲刺攻击]、[闪避反击]造成的伤害提升3%，最多叠加12层，持续15秒，每层效果单独结算持续时间。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Basic Attack, Dodge, Assist, Special Attack, and Chain Attack Lv. +2",
        "zh-CN": "[普通攻击]、[闪避]、[支援技]、[特殊技]、[连携技] 技能等级+2"
      },
      {
        "en": "If Fire Suppression is triggered during the 1st, 2nd, or 3rd hit of Soldier 11's Basic Attack or a Dash Attack, Anti-Interrupt Level increases and DMG received is reduced by 18% during skill activation.\nIf Fire Suppression is triggered during the 4th hit of her Basic Attack, she becomes invulnerable during skill activation.",
        "zh-CN": "[普通攻击]第一、二、三段或[冲刺攻击]发动时，若触发[火力镇压]，则在招式发动期间抗打断等级提升，受到的伤害降低18%；[普通攻击]第四段发动时，若触发[火力镇压]，则在招式发动期间获得无敌效果。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Basic Attack, Dodge, Assist, Special Attack, and Chain Attack Lv. +2",
        "zh-CN": "[普通攻击]、[闪避]、[支援技]、[特殊技]、[连携技] 技能等级+2"
      },
      {
        "en": "When Soldier 11 uses her EX Special Attack, Chain Attack, or Ultimate, she gains 8 stacks of Charge (max 8 stacks).\nWhen Fire Suppression is triggered, 1 stack of Charge is consumed, causing the current move to ignore 25% of the target's Fire RES.",
        "zh-CN": "发动[强化特殊技]、[连携技]或[终结技]时，「11号」获得8层充能（上限8层）；触发[火力镇压]时，消耗1层充能，使当前招式无视目标25%火属性伤害抗性。"
      }
    ]
  }
